[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CONTEMPORARY_MACHINE_GUN]
Contemporary Heavy Machine Gun (Heavy Armor)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CONTEMPORARY_MACHINE_GUN_desc]
A contemporary machine gun is like a socially cringe pony at a party: it just keeps firing, even when everypony else wants it to stop. If you’re exhausted from composing monthly, weekly, or perhaps episodic friendship reports for your boss, why not attempt creating a casualty report for tomorrow’s morning news?
§g“Add you say only friednship is magic?”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CONTEMPORARY_MACHINE_GUN_short]
Contemporary Heavy Machine Gun

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CONTEMPORARY_MACHINE_GUN]
现代重机枪 (重甲装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CONTEMPORARY_MACHINE_GUN_desc]
现代机关枪就像聚会上一只有社交牛逼症的小马：它只是不停地发出声音，即使其他小马都希望它停下来。如果您厌倦了为老板撰写每月、每周或者每集的友谊报告，为什么不尝试为明天的晨间新闻创造一份伤亡报告呢？
§g“你说只有友谊才是魔法吗？”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CONTEMPORARY_MACHINE_GUN_short]
现代重机枪
